package hartland

model lexicon locale cs

// The return-reason dimension's bare head word, Czech form. Attested by `returns_by_reason`'s
// pattern «reklamace podle důvodu» and the Czech demo's «… s důvodem Nedorazilo včas» (LR,
// 2026-10-11).
//
// `displayLabel.cs` ("Důvod reklamace") already names the entity, but only as the whole phrase:
// a bare «důvodem» bound nothing, so the composer was told the word was unknown and the reason
// value beside it had no head. One word, one target — `er.entity.reason` is the only reason.
//
// No en twin, deliberately: "reason" is the entity's own name, which already binds it
// (`ttr/lexicon-form-collides-with-name` refuses restating it as a form).

def term return_reason_cs {
    description: "důvod — the return-reason dimension"
    for: er.entity.reason
    forms: ["důvod"]
}
